          ],
          "tile": "autumn"
        },
        "h3u6": {
          "place": "By the lake",
          "lines": [
            [
              "梅",
              "前面就是西湖。",
              "Just ahead is West Lake."
            ],
            [
              "你",
              "太漂亮了！我们走过去吧。",
              "So beautiful! Let's walk over."
